# Attester public keys this anchor will answer, one hex-encoded Ed25519 key per
# line. Get a key with `attester -print-key`.
#
# Blank lines and anything after a '#' are ignored. A trailing label after the
# key is ignored too, and is the sane way to remember whose key this is.
#
# The anchor re-reads this file every 30s, so adding a line enrolls a machine
# without a restart. Removing a line is the only revocation mechanism there is.
#
# An empty or missing file means the anchor answers nobody.

